.IX Title "dgr::doc::pod3::dgr 3"
.TH dgr::doc::pod3::dgr 3 2025-11-26 "perl v5.38.2" "DGR library functions"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
